          %p
            A book exposition is in
            %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-98137-6_6"} chapter
            weak (Hopf) bialgebras in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gabriella+B%C3%B6hm"}> Gabriella Böhm
              ,
