              = succeed "," do
                %strong 2226
              %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-3-319-98137-6"} doi
          %p Now these works are understood categorically from the point of view of weak monad theory:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gabriella+B%C3%B6hm"}> Gabriella Böhm
              , Stefaan Caenepeel, Kris Janssen,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Weak bialgebras and monoidal categories
              %strong 39
              (2011), no. 12 (special volume dedicated to Mia Cohen), 4584-4607.
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1103.2261"} arXiv:1103.226
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gabriella+B%C3%B6hm"}> Gabriella Böhm
              ,
