          %p
            The relation to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fusion+categories"} fusion categories
            is discussed in
          %ul#Ostrik
            %li
              %p
                Takahiro Hayashi,
                %em A canonical Tannaka duality for finite semisimple tensor categories
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/9904073"}> arXiv:math/9904073
