                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0111139"}> arXiv:math/0111139
                )
          %p
            On the relation to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Frobenius+algebra"} Frobenius algebras
          %ul
            %li#BNS99
              %p
